{"seq":2,"slug":"inference-optimization","title":"推理优化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/llm-fundamentals/deployment-and-inference/inference-optimization","wordCount":926,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"推理优化\">推理优化</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>推理优化的所有手段都服务于同一组瓶颈，几个关键概念如下：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Prefill 与 Decode 两阶段</strong>：Prefill 并行处理输入、是计算密集型；Decode 逐 token 生成、是内存带宽密集型，两者瓶颈不同、优化手段也不同。</li>\n<li><strong>KV 缓存</strong>：自回归生成需缓存历史 K/V，是推理中最大的显存消耗来源，其大小随层数、KV 头数、序列长度线性增长。</li>\n<li><strong>投机解码</strong>：用小草稿模型快速预测多 token、大模型并行验证，接受率高时加速 1.5-3x 且不损失质量。</li>\n<li><strong>批处理策略</strong>：静态批处理等凑满一批、延迟高；连续批处理完成的请求立即替换，显著提升吞吐。</li>\n<li><strong>关键指标</strong>：TTFT（首 token 延迟）、ITL（token 间延迟）、吞吐量（tokens/s）与 GPU 利用率，是评价优化的统一口径。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一条主线是**「先分清瓶颈在哪一阶段，再选对应手段」**：Decode 阶段受内存带宽而非算力限制，因此 KV 缓存压缩、投机解码、连续批处理这些减少访存或提高并发的技术，收益远大于单纯提升算力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理性能瓶颈\">推理性能瓶颈</h2><p>LLM 推理面临独特的性能挑战：模型体积大、自回归生成逐 token 顺序执行、长序列的 KV 缓存占用大量显存。理解这些瓶颈是优化的第一步。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph 推理两阶段&#10;        P[&quot;Prefill 阶段&lt;br/&gt;处理输入 prompt&lt;br/&gt;计算密集型&quot;]&#10;        D[&quot;Decode 阶段&lt;br/&gt;逐 token 生成&lt;br/&gt;内存带宽密集型&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    P --&gt; D\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph 推理两阶段\n        P[\"Prefill 阶段&lt;br/&gt;处理输入 prompt&lt;br/&gt;计算密集型\"]\n        D[\"Decode 阶段&lt;br/&gt;逐 token 生成&lt;br/&gt;内存带宽密集型\"]\n    end\n    P --&gt; D</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>瓶颈</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>优化方向</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Prefill</td>\n<td>计算</td>\n<td>并行处理所有输入 token</td>\n<td>提高 GPU 利用率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Decode</td>\n<td>内存带宽</td>\n<td>逐 token 顺序生成</td>\n<td>减少内存访问</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"kv-缓存优化\">KV 缓存优化</h2><p>KV 缓存是推理中最大的显存消耗来源之一。以下技术用于减少 KV 缓存的开销：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def estimate_kv_cache_size(&#10;    num_layers, num_kv_heads, head_dim, seq_len, batch_size, dtype_bytes=2&#10;):&#10;    total = 2 * num_layers * num_kv_heads * head_dim * seq_len * batch_size * dtype_bytes&#10;    return total&#10;&#10;configs = {&#10;    &quot;LLaMA-3.1-8B&quot;: {&quot;layers&quot;: 32, &quot;kv_heads&quot;: 8, &quot;head_dim&quot;: 128},&#10;    &quot;LLaMA-3.1-70B&quot;: {&quot;layers&quot;: 80, &quot;kv_heads&quot;: 8, &quot;head_dim&quot;: 128},&#10;    &quot;Qwen2.5-72B&quot;: {&quot;layers&quot;: 80, &quot;kv_heads&quot;: 8, &quot;head_dim&quot;: 128},&#10;}&#10;&#10;for name, cfg in configs.items():&#10;    for seq_len in [4096, 32768, 131072]:&#10;        size = estimate_kv_cache_size(&#10;            cfg[&quot;layers&quot;], cfg[&quot;kv_heads&quot;], cfg[&quot;head_dim&quot;],&#10;            seq_len, batch_size=1&#10;        )&#10;        print(f&quot;{name:20s} seq={seq_len:&gt;7,}: KV Cache = {size / 1e9:.2f} GB&quot;)&#10;    print()\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> estimate_kv_cache_size</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    num_layers, num_kv_heads, head_dim, seq_len, batch_size, dtype_bytes</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 2</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_layers </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> num_kv_heads </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> head_dim </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> batch_size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dtype_bytes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">configs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"LLaMA-3.1-8B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kv_heads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"head_dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"LLaMA-3.1-70B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kv_heads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"head_dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">    \"Qwen2.5-72B\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">80</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kv_heads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">8</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"head_dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">128</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">},</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> name, cfg </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> configs.items():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> seq_len </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">4096</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32768</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">131072</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> estimate_kv_cache_size(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"layers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"kv_heads\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], cfg[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"head_dim\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            seq_len, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">batch_size</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        )</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:20s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> seq=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">seq_len</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:>7,</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: KV Cache = </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">/</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1e9</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:.2f</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> GB\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">()</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>KV 缓存优化技术</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>节省比例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GQA</td>\n<td>多个 Q 头共享 KV</td>\n<td>4-8x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PagedAttention</td>\n<td>虚拟内存管理 KV</td>\n<td>减少碎片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>KV 量化</td>\n<td>将 KV 缓存量化为 INT8/FP8</td>\n<td>2-4x</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口</td>\n<td>只保留最近 N 个 token</td>\n<td>N/seq_len</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Token 驱逐</td>\n<td>移除不重要的 KV</td>\n<td>动态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"投机解码\">投机解码</h2><p>投机解码（Speculative Decoding）使用一个小型&quot;草稿模型&quot;快速生成多个候选 token，然后用大模型并行验证。被接受的 token 直接使用，被拒绝的从大模型重新采样：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    subgraph 投机解码&#10;        Draft[&quot;草稿模型&lt;br/&gt;(小快)&quot;] --&gt;|&quot;预测 5 tokens&quot;| Verify[&quot;目标模型&lt;br/&gt;(大准)&quot;]&#10;        Verify --&gt;|&quot;接受 3 个&lt;br/&gt;拒绝 2 个&quot;| Output[&quot;输出 3+1 tokens&quot;]&#10;    end\">flowchart LR\n    subgraph 投机解码\n        Draft[\"草稿模型&lt;br/&gt;(小快)\"] --&gt;|\"预测 5 tokens\"| Verify[\"目标模型&lt;br/&gt;(大准)\"]\n        Verify --&gt;|\"接受 3 个&lt;br/&gt;拒绝 2 个\"| Output[\"输出 3+1 tokens\"]\n    end</pre><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"def speculative_decode(draft_model, target_model, prompt, gamma=5):&#10;    accepted = 0&#10;    total = 0&#10;&#10;    draft_tokens = draft_model.generate(prompt, num_tokens=gamma)&#10;    target_probs = target_model.get_probs(prompt + draft_tokens)&#10;&#10;    for i, token in enumerate(draft_tokens):&#10;        draft_prob = draft_model.get_prob(token)&#10;        target_prob = target_probs[i]&#10;&#10;        acceptance_ratio = min(1, target_prob / draft_prob)&#10;        if random.random() &lt; acceptance_ratio:&#10;            accepted += 1&#10;        else:&#10;            break&#10;&#10;    return accepted, gamma&#10;&#10;print(&quot;投机解码效果:&quot;)&#10;acceptance_rates = {&quot;代码生成&quot;: 0.85, &quot;创意写作&quot;: 0.60, &quot;数学推理&quot;: 0.70}&#10;for task, rate in acceptance_rates.items():&#10;    speedup = 1 / (1 - rate + rate / 5)&#10;    print(f&quot;  {task}: 接受率 {rate:.0%} → 约 {speedup:.1f}x 加速&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> speculative_decode</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(draft_model, target_model, prompt, gamma</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">5</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    accepted </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    total </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    draft_tokens </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_model.generate(prompt, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">num_tokens</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">gamma)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    target_probs </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> target_model.get_probs(prompt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> draft_tokens)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, token </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> enumerate</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(draft_tokens):<